<title>SPAIN: Spain CEOE president satisfied with labour reform.</title>
<headline>Spain CEOE president satisfied with labour reform.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of Spanish employer group CEOE, Jose Maria Cuevas, said on Wednesday he was satisfied with the labour reform deal reached with unions.</p>
<p>&quot;The union and employer organisations did everything possible.... to offer their collaboration to modernise our economic situation and, above all, to ensure a high degree of social stability in relations between organisations,&quot; Cuevas told journalists.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
